help.details:
**Access**

Native private-chat commands are open; AI admission is separately granted. Groups require a configured superadministrator's allowlisting and a separate AI grant. A group AI grant admits its members, subject to individual denies; it grants neither private-history access nor module administration. Group AI responds to /ai, mentions or replies to AI messages, not every message. Personal memory never enters shared group/topic context. Core administration stays private; group RSS still requires a group administrator or superadministrator. Controls and one-time approvals remain bound to their owner and current revision. Reopen unavailable panels to read current state, never to replay a mutation.

